[ext_resource type="Resource" path="res://data/enemies/patterns/grubb_ring.tres" id="6"]

; KING GRUBB (S1 seam 4, sl-0104; docs/23 naming act): the fat little
; king every surface goblin answers to, at the bottom of the Warren.
; Three phases, proven mechanisms only, tuned for a TIGHT room:
; P1 THE COURT — keep-range scepter volleys behind his guards;
; P2 THE TANTRUM (≤66%) — the ring joins (45° gaps ARE the answer
;   indoors) and the scepter quickens;
; P3 THE PANIC (≤33%) — the king CHASES, everything denser. A
; dungeon king, not a stat wall: 420 hp [T] < the world boss.
; All numbers [T]; speeds under the 3.6 floor.

